  "description": "📝 DESCRIPTION :\nMake your Christmas tree extra special with this beautiful Personalized Family Christmas Tree Ornament SVG! This festive layered design features a Christmas tree decorated with colorful ornaments that can be personalized with family members’ names.\nThe design includes a classic Christmas tree silhouette, star topper, winding garland, colorful red and green baubles, decorative stars, evergreen trees, and a customizable family name and year plaque at the bottom.\nAdd children’s names, grandchildren’s names, pets’ names, or the names of loved ones to create a meaningful personalized family Christmas keepsake.\nPerfect for laser cutting from wood, plywood, MDF, or acrylic, this design is ideal for Christmas tree decorations, handmade gifts, family keepsakes, and holiday craft projects.\n📁 INCLUDED FILE FORMATS:\nSVG\nAI\nEPS\nPDF\nDXF\nDWG\n🪵 COMPATIBLE WITH:\nGlowforge\nxTool\nLightBurn\nCricut Maker\nOMTech\nThunder Laser\nEpilog\nBoss Laser\nCNC Routers\nMost laser cutting and engraving machines",
